<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopian Airlines says hijackers were Ethiopian.</title>
<headline>Ethiopian Airlines says hijackers were Ethiopian.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The two men detained after a hijacked plane crashed in the sea near the Comoro Islands killing at least 67 people were both Ethiopians, Ethiopian Airlines said on Sunday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have now established the identity of the two hijackers who are in detention in the Comoros. They are Ethiopian,&quot; Ethiopian Airlines General Manager Ahmed Kello told Reuters.</p>
</text>
